y systems, traceability controls, and regulatory documentation protocols required for&nbsp;<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>export-oriented <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;</span>TCAM, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Nutraceutical/Food <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>Supplement, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Phytomedicine&nbsp;<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>and Phytopharmaceutical, Fortified Clean-Label Health Food Product and Fruit Beverage regional and international markets.</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; margin: 0cm 0cm .2pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES is subjected to the following regulatory licensing:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Business Application &amp; Registration &ndash;PACRA</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investment Licence- ZDA</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 1.9pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; 