(202, 2, 'grille', 'Corporate Profile', 'Corporate Profile', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 2.85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Company commercial name: African Green Farmers (AGF) Limited<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 2.55pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Fully incorporated limited liability Company on 12<sup>th</sup> March 2025<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 2.3pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->TPIN number: 2003675243`<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investment License secured</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Sector: Agro-Processing &amp; Phytomedicine/phytopharmaceutical Manufacturing</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ownership Structure: Privately held by founding partners</p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 2, '2026-03-02 15:09:29', '', NULL, '2026-03-02 15:12:59', NULL, 1),
(203, 6, 'html', 'Governance Committees & Personalities', 'Governance Committees & Personalities', '<div class=\"gov-section\"><!-- ===== GOVERNANCE COMMITTEES ===== -->\r\n<h2>Governance Committees &amp; Personalities</h2>\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-grid\"><!-- 2.1 Executive Management Committee -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Executive Management Committee <span class=\"badge-committee\">EMC</span></h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Strategic planning &amp; policy approval</li>\r\n<li>Oversees departmental coordination</li>\r\n<li>Budget &amp; investment decisions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 2.2 Governance & Compliance -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?️</div>\r\n<h4>Governance &amp; Compliance</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Ensures regulatory compliance (ZAMRA, ZEMA, GMP, ISO)</li>\r\n<li>Oversees ethical, legal and risk management frameworks</li>\r\n<li>Monitors internal policies, accountability &amp; transparency</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 2.3 Quality Management Committee -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">✅</div>\r\n<h4>Quality Management Committee <span class=\"badge-committee\">QMC</span></h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Ensures GMP/ISO compliance</li>\r\n<li>Reviews internal audits, CAPA, deviations</li>\r\n<li>Approves changes to SOPs/QA systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 2.4 Ethics & Compliance Committee -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">⚖️</div>\r\n<h4>Ethics &amp; Compliance Committee</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Monitors regulatory, legal, environmental compliance</li>\r\n<li>Prevents conflicts of interest</li>\r\n<li>Promotes ethical business conduct</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 2.5 Product Development/R&D Committee -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Product Development / R&amp;D Committee</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Approves new formulations</li>\r\n<li>Oversees clinical validation</li>\r\n<li>Guides innovation strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 2.6 Health & Safety Committee -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Health &amp; Safety Committee</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Implements occupational health/safety policies</li>\r\n<li>Risk assessment &amp; emergency preparedness</li>\r\n<li>Coordinates safety training</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ===== DEPARTMENTS & RESPONSIBILITIES ===== -->\r\n<h2>Departments &amp; Responsibilities</h2>\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-grid\"><!-- 3.1 Production Department -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Production Department</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Executes manufacturing (extraction, formulation, packaging)</li>\r\n<li>Maintains batch records, GMP hygiene</li>\r\n<li>Manages equipment operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.2 Quality Assurance -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Quality Assurance (QA)</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>GMP implementation &amp; document control (SOPs, CAPA)</li>\r\n<li>In-process and post-production checks</li>\r\n<li>Batch release authorization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.3 Quality Control -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Quality Control (QC)</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lab testing (raw materials, in-process, finished products)</li>\r\n<li>Microbiology, chemical, and instrumental testing</li>\r\n<li>Stability testing and sampling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.4 Research & Development -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Research &amp; Development (R&amp;D)</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Product formulation &amp; standardization</li>\r\n<li>Pilot production and validation</li>\r\n<li>Ingredient functionality research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.5 Regulatory Affairs -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Regulatory Affairs</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handles product registration (ZAMRA, MOH)</li>\r\n<li>Prepares dossiers, compliance documentation</li>\r\n<li>Communicates with relevant authorities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.6 Supply Chain & Logistics -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Supply Chain &amp; Logistics</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Procurement of raw materials, capsules, packaging</li>\r\n<li>Warehouse &amp; stock management</li>\r\n<li>Delivery/distribution planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.8 Finance & Accounting -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Finance &amp; Accounting</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Manages budgeting, salaries, audits</li>\r\n<li>Prepares financial statements</li>\r\n<li>Handles L/Cs, T/Ts, and bank relations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.9 Marketing and Sales -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Marketing and Sales</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Develops branding &amp; promotion strategy</li>\r\n<li>Manages media, partnerships, and advertising</li>\r\n<li>Supports product launch</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.10 Human Resources -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Human Resources (HR)</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Staff recruitment, onboarding, and training</li>\r\n<li>Oversees compliance with labor</li>\r\n<li>Evaluates performance &amp; HR policies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.11 Facility Engineering & Maintenance -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>Facility Engineering &amp; Maintenance</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maintains cleanroom, HVAC, utilities</li>\r\n<li>Ensures GMP-compliant infrastructure</li>\r\n<li>Coordinates equipment calibration/repairs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.12 Risk Management -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">⚠️</div>\r\n<h4>Risk Management</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Identifies, assesses, and monitors risks</li>\r\n<li>Develops mitigation strategies and contingency plans</li>\r\n<li>Integrates risk controls into operations and planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.13 IT & Data Systems -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-card-header\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">?</div>\r\n<h4>IT &amp; Data Systems</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Manages data integrity, cyber security, LIMS/ERP</li>\r\n<li>Supports automation and traceability</li>\r\n<li>Digital compliance (e.g., 21 CFR Part 11)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ===== LICENSING AND REGULATORY COMPLIANCE ===== -->\r\n<h2>Licensing and Regulatory Compliance</h2>\r\n<div class=\"license-tag-list\"><span class=\"license-tag\">PACRA &ndash; Business Registration</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZDA &ndash; Investment Licence</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZEMA &ndash; EIA Certificate</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZEMA &ndash; Screening EPB Report</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZEMA &ndash; Waste Management Licence</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZMRA &ndash; Site Approval Certificate</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZMRA &ndash; Product Registration</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZAMRA &ndash; GMP Inspection</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZAMRA &ndash; Manufacturing Licence</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">IMMIGRATION &ndash; Investor Permit</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZABS &ndash; Product Testing &amp; Application</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZABS &ndash; Factory Inspection</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ZABS &ndash; Certification Mark</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">Health Dept &ndash; Premises Hygiene Clearance</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">Health Dept &ndash; Food Safety Inspection</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">Health Dept &ndash; Food Handling Certificate</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">Health Dept &ndash; Occupational Health Risk Assessment</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">Health Dept &ndash; Annual Health Compliance</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">Land Title Deeds (Headmen, Chief, Ministry)</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ISO 9001 &ndash; QMS Initial Certification</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ISO 9001 &ndash; Annual Surveillance</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ISO 22000 &ndash; Food Safety</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ISO 14001 &ndash; Environmental Governance (Initial)</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ISO 14001 &ndash; Annual Surveillance</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ISO 45001 &ndash; OH&amp;S (Initial)</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ISO 45001 &ndash; Annual Surveillance</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ISO 14644 &ndash; Cleanroom Qualification (ISO 5)</span> <span class=\"license-tag\">ISO 14644 &ndash; Annual Re‑certification Audits</span></div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #6c757d;\">* Liste indicative &ndash; certains certificats peuvent &ecirc;tre multiples ou renouvel&eacute;s p&eacute;riodiquement.</p>\r\n</div>', NULL, 0, '', '', 4, '2026-03-02 16:39:27', '', NULL, '2026-03-04 16:44:05', '2026-03-04 16:44:05', 1),
(204, 2, 'timeline', 'Our Vision 2026-2031 (Milestones) ', 'Our Vision 2026-2031 (Milestones) ', '<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>1) Research &amp; Product Development</strong></span><br><strong>2026:</strong> Complete bioactive compound identification for top 5 chronic disease targets (oncology, diabetes, cardiovascular).<br><strong>2027:</strong> Preclinical validation (mechanism-of-action, safety, efficacy) of lead compounds.<br><strong>2028:</strong> Submission of first regulatory dossiers for clinical trials.</li>\r\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2) Clinical &amp; Healthcare Services</span></strong><br><strong>2026&ndash;2027: </strong>Launch pilot on-site herbal clinic in capital city + online health consultation platform (phone, form-based, video) for domestic and regional coverage.<br><strong>2027&ndash;2028: </strong>Expand to 5 additional domestic clinics.<br><strong>2028&ndash;2030:</strong> Establish \"AGF ONE\" AI-assisted platform (Application) to provide a global AI-powered platform for learning, health, marketplace, and community engagement, while enabling scalable revenue tracking and growth.<br><strong>2029:</strong> Begin first clinical trial in collaboration with regional or international hospital networks.</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>3) Community Training &amp; Capacity Building</strong></span><br><strong>2026:</strong> Develop community training curriculum for commercial organic farming of medicinal plants.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>2027:</strong> Train first 500 community members in medicinal plant cultivation and post-harvest processing.<br><strong>2028&ndash;2030: </strong>Scale to train 5,000 community members across Zambia and COMESA region.</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>4) Preventive Nutrition &amp; Health Education</strong></span><br>2026: Launch multi-channel awareness campaigns (TV, radio, social media) on preventive nutrition and home remedies.<br>2027&ndash;2028: Reach 50,000 community members via campaigns and workshops.<br>2029&ndash;2031: Scale awareness programs across Southern Africa with digital platforms (WhatsApp, YouTube, Facebook, TikTok).</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>5) Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em><strong>2026:</strong> Construct and equip GMP-aligned phytopharmaceutical production facility.</em></span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em><strong>2027:</strong> Obtain GMP and GLP certifications.</em></span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em><strong>2028:</strong> Begin commercial production of standardized herbal medicines.</em></span><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em><strong>2029&ndash;2031: </strong>Achieve batch-to-batch consistency, full traceability, and supply to domestic and international markets.</em></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>6) Partnerships &amp; Funding</strong></span><br><em><strong>2026&ndash;2027:</strong> Sign domestic and regional partnerships for research, training, and clinical networks.</em><br><em><strong>2027&ndash;2028: </strong>Establish key international scientific and technical partnerships (universities, GLP labs, clinical networks).</em><br><em><strong>2028&ndash;2031:</strong> Secure blended finance and institutional impact funding (DFIs, IFC, Gates Foundation).</em></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>7) Impact &amp; Scaling</strong></span><br><strong>2028:</strong> Reach first 50,000 patients/clients with herbal and digital health services.<br><strong>2029&ndash;2031:</strong> Expand ecosystem to cover multiple chronic diseases across Zambia, Southern Africa, and select international markets.<br><strong>2031:</strong> AGF fully recognized as a regional leader in standardized phytopharmaceuticals and community health empowerment, with measurable social and health impact metrics.</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">8)</strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Summary: </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .4pt 18.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><strong>These milestones translate AGF&rsquo;s objectives into concrete, measurable checkpoints, covering research, clinical services, community training, manufacturing, partnerships, and impact, making progress visible to investors, donors, and regulators.</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 0, '', '', 4, '2026-03-02 17:26:49', '', NULL, '2026-03-04 13:30:33', NULL, 1),
