;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">9 </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.9759%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 68.4667px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; tab-stops: center 58.15pt right 127.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Supply <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>and <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Logistic </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Officer<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20.0458%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 68.4667px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Bachelor degree in Logistics, Supply Chain Management<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.2131%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 68.4667px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"264\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Overseeing procurement control, inventory and distribution </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51.35px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.74227%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 51.35px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 3.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">10 </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.9759%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 51.35px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Corporate Lawyer<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20.0458%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 51.35px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Holding Law degree/Corporate Business Law </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.2131%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 51.35px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"264\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Overseeing <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>all <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>company&rsquo;s <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>legal matters<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 51.35px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.74227%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 51.35px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 3.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">11 </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.9759%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 51.35px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"177\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Director of Agricultural Operations<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20.0458%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 51.35px;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Master&rsquo;s degree in agricultural engineering </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 58.2131%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.35pt 0cm 0cm 5.2pt; height: 51.35px;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"264\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Overseeing the crop/medicinal plant organic industrial farming </span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, 0, '', '', 2, '2026-03-02 21:55:49', '', NULL, '2026-03-02 22:01:08', NULL, 1),
(211, 18, 'hero', 'strategic partnerships', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners  ', '', '/attachments/Sections/2026030300030469a60918e5854.jpg', 0, '', '', 0, '2026-03-03 00:03:04', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 00:03:44', NULL, 1),
(212, 18, 'liste_card', '', '', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm 20.75pt 0cm;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collaborates with a carefully structured network of domestic, regional, and international partners. These partnerships integrate scientific research, clinical validation, manufacturing expertise, regulatory guidance, and financial support to ensure that all natural medicines we produce are safe, standardized, and globally credible.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Research &amp; Scientific Validation</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: University of Zambia &ndash; preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: University of Cape Town &ndash; pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling. International: Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet &ndash; mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Clinical Trials &amp; Healthcare Networks</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics &ndash; patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: Regional referral hospitals &ndash; coordination and management of clinical studies. International: MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic &ndash; oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>3.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Regulatory &amp; Market Authorization</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority &ndash; product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: COMESA regulatory authorities &ndash; regional alignment and compliance support. International: World Health Organization &ndash; guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>4.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards. Domestic: Local GMP consultants &ndash; facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: Regional certification firms &ndash; batch standardization and quality assurance. International: SGS, Bureau Veritas, T&Uuml;V Rheinland &ndash; GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>5.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Safety &amp; Preclinical Testing</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Local preclinical labs &ndash; initial toxicity and safety screening.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: Regional GLP labs &ndash; organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</p>\r\n<p>International: Charles River Laboratories, Evotec &ndash; GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>6.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Financial &amp; Development Partners</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Bank of Zambia, local DFIs &ndash; seed funding and ESG advisory.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: African Development Bank &ndash; capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</p>\r\n<p>International: International Finance Corporation, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &ndash; impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Conclusion</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Through this integrated network of financial, technical, and scientific partners, AGFPHYTOMED ensures that every step of its phytopharmaceutical development is scientifically validated, clinically proven, and manufactured to international quality standards. These collaborations allow us to deliver safe, standardized, and globally credible natural medicines that address high-burden chronic diseases while attracting investment, enabling market access, and generating measurable social and health impact.</span></p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 0, '2026-03-03 00:09:04', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 00:39:10', '2026-03-03 00:39:10', 1),
(213, 18, 'grille', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collaborates with a carefully structured network of domestic, regional, and international partners. These partnerships integrate scientific research, clinical validation, manufacturing expertise, regulatory guidance, and financial support to ensure that all natural medicines we produce are safe, standardized, and globally credible.', '<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>1. Research & Scientific Validation</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> University of Zambia – preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> University of Cape Town – pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet – mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>2. Clinical Trials & Healthcare Networks</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics – patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional referral hospitals – coordination and management of clinical studies.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic – oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>3. Regulatory & Market Authorization</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority – product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> COMESA regulatory authorities – regional alignment and compliance support.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> World Health Organization – guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>4. Manufacturing & Quality Assurance</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Local GMP consultants – facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional certification firms – batch standardization and quality assurance.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> SGS, Bureau Veritas, TÜV Rheinland – GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>5. Safety & Preclinical Testing</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Local preclinical labs – initial toxicity and safety screening.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional GLP labs – organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> Charles River Laboratories, Evotec – GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>6. Financial & Development Partners</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Bank of Zambia, local DFIs – seed funding and ESG advisory.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> African Development Bank – capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> International Finance Corporation, Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation – impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\"><strong>Conclusion</strong><br>Through this integrated network of financial, technical, and scientific partners, AGF-PHYTOMED ensures that every step of its phytopharmaceutical development is scientifically validated, clinically proven, and manufactured to international quality standards. These collaborations allow us to deliver safe, standardized, and globally credible natural medicines that address high-burden chronic diseases while attracting investment, enabling market access, and generating measurable social and health impact.</p>', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 2, '2026-03-03 00:17:14', 'partners-grid', '{\"layout\": \"grid\", \"columns\": 2, \"card_style\": \"bordered\", \"gap\": \"lg\", \"padding\": \"md\", \"bg_color\": \"#f8f9fa\", \"title_size\": \"h3\"}', '2026-03-03 00:39:01', '2026-03-03 00:39:01', 1);
INSERT INTO `sections_contenu` (`id_section`, `id_page`, `type_section`, `titre_section`, `sous_titre`, `contenu_texte`, `image_url`, `image_droite`, `bouton_texte`, `bouton_lien`, `ordre`, `created_at`, `custom_class`, `options_json`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `est_active`) VALUES
(214, 18, 'liste', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collabore avec un réseau soigneusement structuré de partenaires domestiques, régionaux et internationaux.', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>1. Research & Scientific Validation</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Valider les composés végétaux.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Université de Zambie (recherche préclinique).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Université du Cap (études pharmacologiques).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> Harvard, Oxford, Karolinska (validation de mécanismes).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>2. Clinical Trials & Healthcare Networks</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Mener des études sur l\'homme.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Hôpitaux de Lusaka (recrutement de patients).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Hôpitaux régionaux de référence (coordination).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> MD Anderson, Mayo Clinic (collaboration sur les essais).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>3. Regulatory & Market Authorization</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Assurer la conformité.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> ZAMRA (enregistrement des produits).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Autorités du COMESA (alignement).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> Organisation mondiale de la santé (conseils).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>4. Manufacturing & Quality Assurance</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Production aux normes BPF.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Consultants locaux en BPF (audits).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Sociétés de certification régionales (assurance qualité).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> SGS, Bureau Veritas, TÜV Rheinland (certification BPF).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>5. Safety & Preclinical Testing</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Confirmer la sécurité préclinique.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Laboratoires précliniques locaux (criblage de toxicité).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Laboratoires BPL régionaux (études de toxicité).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> Charles River Laboratories, Evotec (études habilitantes).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>6. Financial & Development Partners</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Fournir du financement et des conseils ESG.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Banque de Zambie, IFD locales (financement de démarrage).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Banque africaine de développement (mobilisation de capitaux).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> IFC, Fondation Gates (financement à impact).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Conclusion:</strong> Grâce à ce réseau intégré, AGF-PHYTOMED s\'assure que le développement de ses produits est scientifiquement validé, cliniquement prouvé et fabriqué selon les normes internationales, nous permettant de fournir des médicaments naturels sûrs et crédibles à l\'échelle mondiale.</p>', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 2, '2026-03-03 00:20:09', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 00:38:50', '2026-03-03 00:38:49', 1),
(215, 18, 'liste_card', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collabore avec un réseau soigneusement structuré de partenaires domestiques, régionaux et internationaux. Ces partenariats intègrent la recherche scientifique, la validation clinique, l\'expertise en fabrication, les conseils réglementaires et le soutien financier afin de garantir que tous les médicaments naturels que nous produisons sont sûrs, standardisés et crédibles à l\'échelle mondiale.', '<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Research &amp; Scientific Validation:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: University of Zambia &ndash; preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: University of Cape Town &ndash; pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling. International: Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet &ndash; mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Clinical Trials &amp; Healthcare Networks:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics &ndash; patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional referral hospitals &ndash; coordination and management of clinical studies. International: MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic &ndash; oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Regulatory &amp; Market Authorization:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority &ndash; product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: COMESA regulatory authorities &ndash; regional alignment and compliance support. International: World Health Organization &ndash; guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards. Domestic: Local GMP consultants &ndash; facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional certification firms &ndash; batch standardization and quality assurance. International: SGS, Bureau Veritas, T&Uuml;V Rheinland &ndash; GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Safety &amp; Preclinical Testing:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Local preclinical labs &ndash; initial toxicity and safety screening.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional GLP labs &ndash; organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: Charles River Laboratories, Evotec &ndash; GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Financial &amp; Development Partners:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Bank of Zambia, local DFIs &ndash; seed funding and ESG advisory.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: African Development Bank &ndash; capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: International Finance Corporation, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &ndash; impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Conclusion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 2, '2026-03-03 00:20:41', 'partners-grid', '{\"layout\": \"grid\", \"columns\": 2, \"card_style\": \"bordered\", \"gap\": \"lg\", \"padding\": \"md\", \"bg_color\": \"#f8f9fa\", \"title_size\": \"h4\"}', '2026-03-03 00:49:58', '2026-03-03 00:49:57', 1),
(216, 18, 'texte', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collabore avec un réseau soigneusement structuré de partenaires domestiques, régionaux et internationaux. Ces partenariats intègrent la recherche scientifique, la validation clinique, l\'expertise en fabrication, les conseils réglementaires et le soutien financier afin de garantir que tous les médicaments naturels que nous produisons sont sûrs, standardisés et crédibles à l\'échelle mondiale.', '<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Research &amp; Scientific Validation:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose: </strong>Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic: </strong>University of Zambia &ndash; preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> University of Cape Town &ndash; pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling. International: Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet &ndash; mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Clinical Trials &amp; Healthcare Networks:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics &ndash; patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional referral hospitals &ndash; coordination and management of clinical studies. International: MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic &ndash; oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Regulatory &amp; Market Authorization:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic: </strong>Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority &ndash; product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> COMESA regulatory authorities &ndash; regional alignment and compliance support. International: World Health Organization &ndash; guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards. Domestic: Local GMP consultants &ndash; facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional certification firms &ndash; batch standardization and quality assurance. International: SGS, Bureau Veritas, T&Uuml;V Rheinland &ndash; GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Safety &amp; Preclinical Testing:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Local preclinical labs &ndash; initial toxicity and safety screening.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional GLP labs &ndash; organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: Charles River Laboratories, Evotec &ndash; GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Financial &amp; Development Partners:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Bank of Zambia, local DFIs &ndash; seed funding and ESG advisory.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> African Development Bank &ndash; capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: International Finance Corporation, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &ndash; impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Conclusion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 2, '2026-03-03 00:20:41', 'partners-grid', '{\"layout\": \"grid\", \"columns\": 2, \"card_style\": \"bordered\", \"gap\": \"lg\", \"padding\": \"md\", \"bg_color\": \"#f8f9fa\", \"title_size\": \"h4\"}', '2026-03-03 01:22:33', NULL, 1),
(217, 16, 'hero', 'Commission Fee Payment to Brokers  ', 'Commission Fee Payment to Brokers  ', '', '/attachments/Sections/2026030301143669a619dcba0ca.jpg', 0, '', '', 0, '2026-03-03 01:14:36', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(218, 16, 'liste_card', 'Commission Fee Payment to Brokers', 'At AGF: ', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->We view <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Capital Introduction Brokers</em> as strategic partners and protect commercial interests</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->We honor and strictly adhere to Broker Agreement bearing the Public Notary&rsquo;s endorsement with absolute integrity and transparency</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Commissions agreed upon in our bilateral agreement are paid as promptly as the successful funds are secured/disbursed</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 8.75pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->No upfront commission fees accepted</strong></span></p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 1, '2026-03-03 01:24:53', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 01:25:24', NULL, 1),
(219, 15, 'hero', 'Our Investor Partner Commitment', 'Our Investor Partner Commitment', '', '/attachments/Sections/2026030301334369a61e57cbcb0.jpg', 0, '', '', 0, '2026-03-03 01:33:43', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 01:34:32', NULL, 1),
(220, 15, 'grille_card', ' Our Investor & Partner Commitment', ' (Building Trust Through Transparency, Accountability, and Strategic Growth)', '<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 103%; color: black;\">Our Commitment to Investors, Donors &amp; Financial Brokers&nbsp;</span></strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;At AGF, we are dedicated to maximizing impact while ensuring financial integrity. Our approach combines:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Non-fund Diversion Policy: Legally binding restricted use of proceeds covenant</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Transparency: Clear reporting of funds, expenditures, and project outcomes</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Accountability: Governance structures and audit-ready processes</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; color: black;\"><strong>Financial Governance and Oversight&nbsp;</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">AGF adheres to international best practices in financial management, including:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Independent audits and financial reviews</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Robust internal controls to safeguard assets</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Board-level oversight of all financial decisions</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Compliance with local and international regulations and reporting standards</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investors and donors can trust that funds are managed efficiently, ethically, and in full compliance</span>.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 103%; color: black;\">Investment Opportunities </span></strong></span><br>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">AGF offers strategically structured investment opportunities designed to generate measurable returns while supporting health, nutrition, sustainable economic development and sustainable agriculture initiatives:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Seed and growth-stage funding for AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES and digital platforms</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Co-investment opportunities with regional and international partners</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ESG-aligned projects focusing on preventive nutrition, functional foods, and organic farming of target medicinal plants, functional nutrient-dense crops, fruits and vegetables serving as raw materials for our manufacturing facility</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investments are linked to clear KPIs and market expansion metrics, ensuring measurable impact and visibility.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong>Donor Engagement and Impact</strong></span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Donors are a critical part of AGF&rsquo;s mission. We provide:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Regular impact reports highlighting social, environmental, and health outcomes</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Transparent tracking of funds toward community programs, research, and digital outreach</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Recognition of donors in line with preferences and contribution scale</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Donors can see how every contribution translates into real-world health, economic, gendersensitive job creation and social impact.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 103%; color: black;\"><span style=\"line-height: 103%; color: black;\">Financial Reporting and Transparency </span>&nbsp;</span></strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">AGF prioritizes real-time financial visibility:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Quarterly and annual financial statements</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Online dashboards with project-wise and program-wise fund allocation</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Key Performance Indicator (KPI) tracking linked to market growth, community engagement, and ESG performance</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">This ensures investors and donors can monitor the impact of their support anytime.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; font-size: 24pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: 103%; color: black;\">Why Partner With AGF? </span></strong></span><br>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Proven track record: 235+ WhatsApp groups, 211,500+ participants, growing daily</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->AI-driven digital marketing and community engagement for measurable reach</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Robust governance, compliance, and audit-ready processes</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Clear investment structure with ESG-aligned, high-impact projects</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Dedicated investor, donor &amp; broker relations team providing personalized support and reporting</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 0, '', '', 0, '2026-03-03 01:36:16', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 02:22:59', NULL, 1),
(221, 15, 'liste_card', 'Our Commitment to Investors, Donors & Financial Brokers', 'At AGF, we are dedicated to maximizing impact while ensuring financial integrity. Our approach combines:', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Non-fund Diversion Policy: Legally binding restricted use of proceeds covenant</strong></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Transparency: Clear reporting of funds, expenditures, and project outcomes</strong></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Accountability: Governance structures and audit-ready processes</strong></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Sustainability: Long-term strategies for profitable, socially responsible, and ESG-aligned growth</strong></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Our goal is to ensure every investment and donation directly contributes to market expansion, sustainable community development and health impact.</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 0, '', '', 1, '2026-03-03 01:45:01', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 02:24:01', '2026-03-03 02:24:01', 1);
INSERT INTO `sections_contenu` (`id_section`, `id_page`, `type_section`, `titre_section`, `sous_titre`, `contenu_texte`, `image_url`, `image_droite`, `bouton_texte`, `bouton_lien`, `ordre`, `created_at`, `custom_class`, `options_json`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `est_active`) VALUES
(222, 15, 'grille_card', ' Financial Governance and Oversight', 'AGF adheres to international best practices in financial management, including:', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Independent audits and financial reviews</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Robust internal controls to safeguard assets</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Board-level oversight of all financial decisions</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Compliance with local and international regulations and reporting standards</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Investors and donors can trust that funds are managed efficiently, ethically, and in full compliance.</strong></span></p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 0, '2026-03-03 01:46:40', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 02:24:36', '2026-03-03 02:24:34', 1),
(223, 15, 'grille', 'Investment Opportunities', '   AGF offers strategically structured investment opportunities designed to generate measurable returns while supporting health, nutrition, sustainable economic development and sustainable agriculture initiatives:', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Seed and growth-stage funding for AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES and digital platforms</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Co-investment opportunities with regional and international partners</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>ESG-aligned projects focusing on preventive nutrition, functional foods, and organic farming of target medicinal plants, functional nutrient-dense crops, fruits and vegetables serving as raw materials for our manufacturing facility</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Investments are linked to clear KPIs and market expansion metrics, ensuring measurable impact and visibility.</strong></span></p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 3, '2026-03-03 01:49:47', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 02:23:43', '2026-03-03 02:23:43', 1),
(224, 15, 'liste', 'Donor Engagement and Impact', 'Donors are a critical part of AGF’s mission. We provide:', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Regular impact reports highlighting social, environmental, and health outcomes</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Transparent tracking of funds toward community programs, research, and digital outreach</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Recognition of donors in line with preferences and contribution scale</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Donors can see how every contribution translates into real-world health, economic, gendersensitive job creation and social impact.</strong></span></p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 0, '2026-03-03 01:53:29', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 02:24:23', '2026-03-03 02:24:23', 1),
(225, 14, 'hero', 'Phased Investment Projection ', 'Phased Investment Projection ', '', '/attachments/Sections/2026030302450869a62f149a178.jpg', 0, '', '', 0, '2026-03-03 02:45:08', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 02:57:39', '2026-03-03 02:57:39', 1),
(226, 14, 'hero', 'Phased Investment Projection', 'USD 40+ Million Seed Capital (2026–2029)', '<p class=\"lead\">African Green Farmers Limited (AGF) &ndash; AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY &ndash; seeks to mobilize USD 40+ million in phased seed capital dedicated to construction, commissioning, and operationalization of a GMP-compliant phytomedicine and nutraceutical processing facility.</p>', '/attachments/Sections/2026030302571969a631efd9092.jpg', 0, '', '', 1, '2026-03-03 02:54:12', 'investment-hero', '{\"overlay_opacity\": 0.7, \"height\": \"70vh\"}', '2026-03-03 02:57:19', NULL, 1),
(227, 14, 'texte', 'Strategic Investment Approach', 'Years 1-5: No Seed Capital to Farming', '<div class=\"investment-highlight\" style=\"background: white; border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border: 2px solid var(--accent);\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 20px;\">$40+ Million <span style=\"color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 400; display: block;\">Seed Capital</span></div>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gray); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">During the first 5 years of operation, AGF will not allocate seed capital to commercial farming activities. All raw botanical, Spirulina and organic fertilizer inputs will be secured through structured external contractual supply agreements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 20px;\">This model significantly reduces early-stage agricultural risk and accelerates industrial revenue generation.</p>\r\n</div>', NULL, 0, '', '', 2, '2026-03-03 02:54:13', 'investment-overview', '{\"text_align\": \"center\"}', '2026-03-03 03:12:43', NULL, 1),
(228, 14, 'grille_card', 'Seed Capital Allocation Strategy', 'Seed Capital Allocation Strategy (Years 1–5) ', '<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">A.<span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Facility Construction &amp; Industrial Infrastructure </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Construction of the AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES processing facility</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Pre-built GMP cleanrooms for critical processing zones</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->HVAC systems with controlled pressure gradients</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Clean steam and purified water systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Waste management and solvent recovery systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Hybrid power systems (solar + backup generation)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Fire suppression and safety compliance systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Stuff Residential Units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">B. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Processing &amp; Production Equipment </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">A fully automated and integrated high-throughput<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"> </em>Turnkey <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Ultrasound-Assisted Extraction (UAE) Line System</em> integrating (In a single line system) essentially post-harvest processing of plant raw materials, validated solvent-based extraction, concentration, chromatographic purification, vacuum drying, micronization and ultrasonic vibratory sieving, anti-cracking agent aseptic incorporation, capsule and tablet production, bottle filling, capping and sealing, cartooning, instructional labeling and leaflet inserting, post-packaging High Pressure Processing (HPP) Optimization (Non-thermal sterilization) and case packaging.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This is a GMP-Compliant manufacturing efficiency within a single continuous end-to-end line system, approximately 60m x 5m in size. The line system manufactures any target extracts from any medicinal plants based on our need. This is the only processing line system to be secured using the seed capital.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">The rest of manufacturing line systems such as the Soybean Product (Fortified Liquid Soymilk, Soymilk Powder and Vacuum-dried Tofu) Integrated Manufacturing Line System, Spirulina Algae Supplement Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System, Fruit Juice Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System, and Organic Fertilizer Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System will be secured and utilized using the facility&rsquo;s income-generating activities, mainly sales.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">C. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Laboratory &amp; Quality Control Infrastructure </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 12.8pt;\">Analytical laboratory and scientific research laboratory equipment, including UHPLCMS/MS, GC-MS/MS 8000,<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"> </span></strong>HPAAS, AH SN600 Laser Scanning Microscope, RT-qPCR and High-Parameter Digital Flow Cytometer for:<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Microbiology laboratory </strong>for testing microorganisms and biological contamination of raw materials and finished products</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Analytical laboratory (QC Lab)</strong> that performs testing for product profiling and standardization</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Preclinical <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>laboratory</strong> <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>performing <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>product <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>toxicology, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>safety, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>and pharmacokinetics</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">GLP </strong>(Good Laboratory Practice) <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">laboratory </strong>that generates non-clinical data before human trials</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Clinical research laboratory</strong> that analyses clinical study samples</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">D. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Regulatory, Licensing &amp; Certification </span></h4>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Regulatory and licensing in which the seed capital will be utilized include the following:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Business Application &amp; Registration &ndash;PACRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investment Licence- ZDA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) Certificate- ZEMA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Screening EPB Report Certificate- ZEMA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Waste Management Licence- ZEMA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Site Approval Certificate- ZMRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Product Registration- ZMRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->GMP Inspection- ZAMRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Manufacturing Licence- ZAMRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 14.05pt;\">Investor Permit- IMMIGRATION</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 14.05pt;\">Product Testing &amp; Application- ZABS</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 14.05pt;\">Factory Inspection- ZABS</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Certification Mark- ZABS</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Premises Hygiene Clearance Certificate- Local Health Department (Munispal/District Health Office)<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Food Safety Inspection/Compliance Certificate-<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>Local Health Department (Munispal /District Health Office)<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Food Handling/Safety Certificate- Local Health Department (Munispal /District Health Office)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Occupational Health Risk Assessment Certificate- Local Health Department (Munispal/ District<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Local Health Department (Munispal /District Health Office)- Annual Health Compliance Verification</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Land Title Deeds- Headmen, Chief, Chiebombo District, Province &amp;Ministry of Land</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 9001-Quality Management System- Initial Certification</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 9001-Quality Management System- Annual Surveillance</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 22000-Food Safety</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14001- Environmental Gouvernance and Sustainability- Initial Certification</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14001- Environmental Gouvernance and Sustainability- Annual Surveillance</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 45001- Occupational Health &amp; Safety- Initial Certification</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 45001- Occupational Health &amp; Safety- Annual Surveillance Audits</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14644- Cleanroom Qualification ISO 5/Room x 10</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14644- Cleanroom Annual Re-certification Audits ISO 5/Room x 10</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">E. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Operationalization &amp; Market Deployment </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Salaries for skilled staff recruitment and training</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Salaries for executive management<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Rent of headquarters, domestic health shops<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>and regional distribution outlets</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Distribution fleet acquisition</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Executive coordination vehicle</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ERP and digital traceability systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Branding, packaging design, and market launch</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Insurance (facility, liability, professional indemnity)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Security systems and facility access control</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', NULL, 0, '', '', 3, '2026-03-03 02:54:13', 'investment-allocation', '{\"columns\": 2, \"gap\": 25}', '2026-03-03 03:03:21', NULL, 1),
(229, 14, 'tableau', 'Regulatory, Licensing & Certification', 'Complete compliance framework', '<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\r\n        <thead class=\"bg-primary text-white\">\r\n            <tr><th>Certification / License</th><th>Authority</th></tr>\r\n        </thead>\r\n        <tbody>\r\n            <tr><td>Business Application & Registration</td><td>PACRA</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Investment Licence</td><td>ZDA</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Environmental Impact Assessment</td><td>ZEMA</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Screening EPB Report</td><td>ZEMA</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Waste Management Licence</td><td>ZEMA</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Site Approval Certificate</td><td>ZMRA</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Product Registration</td><td>ZMRA</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>GMP Inspection</td><td>ZAMRA</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Manufacturing Licence</td><td>ZAMRA</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Investor Permit</td><td>IMMIGRATION</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Product Testing & Application</td><td>ZABS</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Factory Inspection</td><td>ZABS</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Certification Mark</td><td>ZABS</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Premises Hygiene Clearance</td><td>Local Health Dept</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Food Safety Inspection</td><td>Local Health Dept</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Food Handling Certificate</td><td>Local Health Dept</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Occupational Health Assessment</td><td>Local Health Dept</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Annual Health Compliance</td><td>Local Health Dept</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>Land Title Deeds</td><td>Ministry of Land</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>ISO 9001 Quality Management</td><td>Initial + Annual</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>ISO 22000 Food Safety</td><td>Certification</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>ISO 14001 Environmental</td><td>Initial + Annual</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>ISO 45001 Health & Safety</td><td>Initial + Annual</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>ISO 14644 Cleanroom</td><td>ISO 5 (10 rooms)</td></tr>\r\n        </tbody>\r\n    </table>', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 4, '2026-03-03 02:54:13', 'regulatory-table', '{\"striped\": true, \"bordered\": true}', NULL, NULL, 1),
(230, 14, 'liste_card', 'Raw Material (Years 1–5) ', 'Raw Material (Years 1–5) ', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">During the first operational phase:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Raw medicinal plant materials sourced through contractual supplier agreements</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Spirulina biomass procured through structured external production partnerships</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Multi-supplier diversification to reduce dependency risk</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Quality specifications enforced through pre-supply laboratory validation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This strategy ensures:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Lower early-stage capital exposure</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Reduced climate and agricultural production risk</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Faster time-to-market</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Immediate focus on value-added processing</p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 5, '2026-03-03 02:54:13', 'material-strategy', '{\"columns\": 2, \"icon\": \"check-circle\"}', '2026-03-03 03:07:29', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `sections_contenu` (`id_section`, `id_page`, `type_section`, `titre_section`, `sous_titre`, `contenu_texte`, `image_url`, `image_droite`, `bouton_texte`, `bouton_lien`, `ordre`, `created_at`, `custom_class`, `options_json`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `est_active`) VALUES
(231, 14, 'liste_card', 'Revenue Generation Model', 'Years 1–5: Financing expansion through sales', '<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">3)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Revenue Generation Model (Years 1&ndash;5)</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 18.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Commercial farming expansion and additional equipment acquisition will be financed through internally generated revenues from:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; line-height: 102%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .2pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 102%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Standardized <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>botanical <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>extracts <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>(TCAMs, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Nutraceuticals/Food <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Supplements, Phytomedicines and Phytopharmaceuticals<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">&ndash;</strong>Tablets, capsules, micronized powders, liquid concentrates)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->High-nutrient Organic Fertilizers (Micronized powders and liquid concentrates)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Contract manufacturing services (third-party processing)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Private label production</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Export of semi-processed phytochemical ingredients</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Laboratory analytical services</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Licensing and formulation partnerships</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Revenue reinvestment will finance mainly:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Commercial organic cultivation clusters of target medicinal plants, functional crops, fruits&hellip;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Acquisition of additional high-capacity processing lines</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Vertical integration of priority medicinal crops</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Regional scaling of distribution infrastructure</p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 6, '2026-03-03 02:54:13', 'revenue-model', '{\"columns\": 3, \"gap\": 20}', '2026-03-03 03:09:24', NULL, 1),
(232, 14, 'liste', 'Strategic Rationale & Investor Confidence', 'Why this phased approach?', '<div class=\"row\">\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n            <div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n                <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                    <h3 class=\"text-primary\">🎯 Strategic Rationale</h3>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Reduces agricultural CAPEX exposure</li>\r\n                        <li>Converts seed capital to revenue-generating assets</li>\r\n                        <li>Accelerates EBITDA stabilization</li>\r\n                        <li>De-risks investor capital</li>\r\n                        <li>Strengthens bankability</li>\r\n                        <li>Preserves vertical integration potential</li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 fst-italic\">\"Investors finance processing first — not raw agricultural risk.\"</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n            <div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n                <div class=\"card-body\">\r\n                    <h3 class=\"text-warning\">🔒 Investor Confidence</h3>\r\n                    <ul>\r\n                        <li>Prioritizes industrial cash-flow generation</li>\r\n                        <li>Minimizes early-stage climate exposure</li>\r\n                        <li>Maintains disciplined capital utilization</li>\r\n                        <li>Uses retained earnings to expand</li>\r\n                        <li>Aligns with DFI risk expectations</li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 7, '2026-03-03 02:54:13', 'strategic-rationale', '{\"columns\": 2, \"icon\": \"check\"}', NULL, NULL, 1),
(233, 1, 'texte', 'Gouvernance & Structure Organisationnelle', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES - Organisation et Gouvernance', '<!-- Bootstrap Icons -->\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"governance-wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"container\"><!-- En-tête -->\r\n<div class=\"header\">\r\n<h1>AFRICAN GREEN FARMERS LIMITED</h1>\r\n<p>Structure de Gouvernance &amp; Organisationnelle - AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"governance-grid\"><!-- NIVEAU 1 : BOARD & CEO -->\r\n<div class=\"top-level\"><!-- Board of Directors -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card board\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"gov-title\">Board of Directors</div>\r\n<div class=\"gov-badge\">Strategic Oversight</div>\r\n<div class=\"gov-desc\">Provision of strategic direction, risk supervision, and investor protection. Supervise la performance globale et la conformit&eacute;.</div>\r\n<ul class=\"gov-list\">\r\n<li>Strategic planning &amp; policy approval</li>\r\n<li>Budget &amp; investment decisions</li>\r\n<li>Risk supervision &amp; investor protection</li>\r\n<li>Oversight of executive management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- CEO -->\r\n<div class=\"gov-card ceo\">\r\n<div class=\"gov-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"gov-title\">Chief Executive Officer (CEO)</div>\r\n<div class=\"gov-badge\">Executive Leadership</div>\r\n<div class=\"gov-desc\">Overall management and decision-making. Responsable de la mise en &oelig;uvre de la strat&eacute;gie et de la performance op&eacute;rationnelle.</div>\r\n<ul class=\"gov-list\">\r\n<li>Overall management &amp; decision-making</li>\r\n<li>Implementation of strategic direction</li>\r\n<li>Coordination of all departments</li>\r\n<li>Stakeholder communication</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"connector\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<!-- NIVEAU 2 : COMITÉS DE GOUVERNANCE -->\r\n<div class=\"committees-level\">\r\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Governance Committees &amp; Personalities</h2>\r\n<div class=\"committees-grid\"><!-- 2.1 Executive Management Committee -->\r\n<div class=\"committee-card\">\r\n<div class=\"committee-title\">2.1 Executive Management Committee (EMC)</div>\r\n<div class=\"committee-desc\">Strategic planning &amp; policy approval, oversees departmental coordination, budget &amp; investment decisions.</div>\r\n<ul class=\"committee-tasks\">\r\n<li>Strategic planning &amp; policy approval</li>\r\n<li>Oversees departmental coordination</li>\r\n<li>Budget &amp; investment decisions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 2.2 Governance & Compliance -->\r\n<div class=\"committee-card\">\r\n<div class=\"committee-title\">2.2 Governance &amp; Compliance</div>\r\n<div class=\"committee-desc\">Ensures regulatory compliance (ZAMRA, ZEMA, GMP, ISO), oversees ethical, legal and risk management frameworks.</div>\r\n<ul class=\"committee-tasks\">\r\n<li>Ensures regulatory compliance (ZAMRA, ZEMA, GMP, ISO)</li>\r\n<li>Oversees ethical, legal &amp; risk management</li>\r\n<li>Monitors internal policies &amp; accountability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 2.3 Quality Management Committee -->\r\n<div class=\"committee-card\">\r\n<div class=\"committee-title\">2.3 Quality Management Committee (QMC)</div>\r\n<div class=\"committee-desc\">Ensures GMP/ISO compliance, reviews internal audits, CAPA, deviations, approves SOPs/QA changes.</div>\r\n<ul class=\"committee-tasks\">\r\n<li>Ensures GMP/ISO compliance</li>\r\n<li>Reviews internal audits, CAPA, deviations</li>\r\n<li>Approves changes to SOPs/QA systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 2.4 Ethics & Compliance Committee -->\r\n<div class=\"committee-card\">\r\n<div class=\"committee-title\">2.4 Ethics &amp; Compliance Committee</div>\r\n<div class=\"committee-desc\">Monitors regulatory, legal, and environmental compliance, prevents conflicts of interest, promotes ethical conduct.</div>\r\n<ul class=\"committee-tasks\">\r\n<li>Monitors regulatory, legal, environmental compliance</li>\r\n<li>Prevents conflicts of interest</li>\r\n<li>Promotes ethical business conduct</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 2.5 Product Development/R&D Committee -->\r\n<div class=\"committee-card\">\r\n<div class=\"committee-title\">2.5 Product Development/R&amp;D Committee</div>\r\n<div class=\"committee-desc\">Approves new formulations, oversees clinical validation, guides innovation strategy.</div>\r\n<ul class=\"committee-tasks\">\r\n<li>Approves new formulations</li>\r\n<li>Oversees clinical validation</li>\r\n<li>Guides innovation strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 2.6 Health & Safety Committee -->\r\n<div class=\"committee-card\">\r\n<div class=\"committee-title\">2.6 Health &amp; Safety Committee</div>\r\n<div class=\"committee-desc\">Implements occupational health/safety policies, risk assessment, emergency preparedness, safety training.</div>\r\n<ul class=\"committee-tasks\">\r\n<li>Implements occupational health/safety policies</li>\r\n<li>Risk assessment &amp; emergency preparedness</li>\r\n<li>Coordinates safety training</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"connector\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<!-- NIVEAU 3 : DÉPARTEMENTS -->\r\n<div class=\"departments-level\">\r\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Departments &amp; Responsibilities</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dept-grid\"><!-- 3.1 Production -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.1 Production Department</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Executes manufacturing (extraction, formulation, packaging)</li>\r\n<li>Maintains batch records, GMP hygiene</li>\r\n<li>Manages equipment operations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.2 Quality Assurance -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.2 Quality Assurance (QA)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>GMP implementation &amp; document control (SOPs, CAPA)</li>\r\n<li>In-process and post-production checks</li>\r\n<li>Batch release authorization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.3 Quality Control -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.3 Quality Control (QC)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Lab testing (raw materials, in-process, finished products)</li>\r\n<li>Microbiology, chemical, instrumental testing</li>\r\n<li>Stability testing and sampling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.4 R&D -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.4 Research &amp; Development (R&amp;D)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Product formulation &amp; standardization</li>\r\n<li>Pilot production and validation</li>\r\n<li>Ingredient functionality research</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.5 Regulatory Affairs -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.5 Regulatory Affairs</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Handles product registration (ZAMRA, MOH)</li>\r\n<li>Prepares dossiers, compliance documentation</li>\r\n<li>Communicates with relevant authorities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.6 Supply Chain -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.6 Supply Chain &amp; Logistics</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Procurement of raw materials, capsules, packaging</li>\r\n<li>Warehouse &amp; stock management</li>\r\n<li>Delivery/distribution planning</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.8 Finance & Accounting -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.8 Finance &amp; Accounting</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Manages budgeting, salaries, audits</li>\r\n<li>Prepares financial statements</li>\r\n<li>Handles L/Cs, T/Ts, bank relations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.9 Marketing -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.9 Marketing and Sales</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Develops branding &amp; promotion strategy</li>\r\n<li>Manages media, partnerships, advertising</li>\r\n<li>Supports product launch</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.10 Human Resources -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.10 Human Resources (HR)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Staff recruitment, onboarding, training</li>\r\n<li>Oversees compliance with labor</li>\r\n<li>Evaluates performance &amp; HR policies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.11 Facility Engineering -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.11 Facility Engineering &amp; Maintenance</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Maintains cleanroom, HVAC, utilities</li>\r\n<li>Ensures GMP-compliant infrastructure</li>\r\n<li>Coordinates equipment calibration/repairs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.12 Risk Management -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.12 Risk Management</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Identifies, assesses, monitors risks</li>\r\n<li>Develops mitigation strategies</li>\r\n<li>Ensures integration of risk controls</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- 3.13 IT & Data Systems -->\r\n<div class=\"dept-card\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-header\">\r\n<div class=\"dept-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"dept-title\">3.13 IT &amp; Data Systems</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul class=\"dept-tasks\">\r\n<li>Manages data integrity, cyber security</li>\r\n<li>Supports automation and traceability</li>\r\n<li>Digital compliance (21 CFR Part 11)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- SECTION LICENCES -->\r\n<div class=\"licenses-section\">\r\n<h2 class=\"licenses-title\">Regulatory Licensing &amp; Certifications</h2>\r\n<div class=\"licenses-grid\"><!-- PACRA -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Business Application &amp; Registration</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">PACRA</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZDA -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Investment Licence</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZDA</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZEMA - EIA -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Environmental Impact Assessment</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZEMA</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZEMA - EPB -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Screening EPB Report</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZEMA</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZEMA - Waste -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Waste Management Licence</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZEMA</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZMRA - Site -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Site Approval Certificate</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZMRA</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZMRA - Product -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Product Registration</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZMRA</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZAMRA - GMP -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">GMP Inspection</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZAMRA</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZAMRA - Manufacturing -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Manufacturing Licence</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZAMRA</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- IMMIGRATION -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Investor Permit</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">IMMIGRATION</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZABS - Testing -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Product Testing &amp; Application</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZABS</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZABS - Factory -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Factory Inspection</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZABS</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- ZABS - Mark -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Certification Mark</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">ZABS</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Local Health - Hygiene -->\r\n<div class=\"license-item\">\r\n<div class=\"license-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-content\">\r\n<div class=\"license-name\">Premises Hygiene Clearance</div>\r\n<div class=\"license-auth\">Local Health Dept</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Local Health - Food Safety -->\r\n<div class=\"lic