(236, 12, 'texte', 'Digital Growth & Market Expansion Platform ', 'AI-Powered, Multi-Channel, Community-Driven Market Growth ', '<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">1)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Strategic Overview</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .8pt 0cm;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">AGF&rsquo;s Digital Growth &amp; Market Expansion Platform centralizes all strategic digital marketing channels, including existing and ever expanding educational WhatsApp groups, Telegram, Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, email, and website&mdash;into a single coordinated system using HubSpot Marketing Hub. Integrated with ChatGPT AI, this platform automates daily content, advertisements, and community engagement, ensuring scalable, measurable, and professional market expansion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Investor Advantage: Transparent KPIs, real-time analytics, and predictable growth across domestic, regional, and international markets.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">2)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Community &amp; Expert Engagement</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">235+ WhatsApp groups, 211,500+ participants, expanding daily</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Key Partner: NUFOTEC BURUNDI (EAC)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Expert-Led Content: Registered nutritionists, dieticians, and medical professionals provide daily guidance on presentational advices and guidance on:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Acute diseases: e. g. cough, diarrhea, respiratory infections</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Chronic conditions: cancer, diabetes, cardiovascular disease, obesity, child malnutrition</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preventive nutrition, home remedies, and organic farming</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Communities act as active marketing and educational channels, converting engagement into product adoption and economic development.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">3)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>ChatGPT AI Services</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .3pt 0cm;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Role:</strong> Drives all automated content and advertising across AGF&rsquo;s strategic digital marketing channel network<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Automated Daily Content:</strong> Health tips, preventive nutrition, product updates, and home remedies distributed across all our platforms</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Automated Advertisements: </strong>Targeted domestic, regional, and international campaigns</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Real-Time Community Interaction: 24/7 AI-powered assistance and feedback capture</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Analytics &amp; Reporting:</strong> Tracks engagement, adoption, and ESG impact via real-time dashboards</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Impact:</strong> ChatGPT ensures continuous, coordinated, and measurable outreach, transforming communities into active market channels.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">4)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Market Expansion Impact</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Fast adoption and brand recognition</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Regional (EAC, COMESA, SADC)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->AI-optimized content for cross-border engagement</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Easy international outreach</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 22.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Automated campaigns reach global distributors and partners</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">5)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Investor &amp; Donor Highlights</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 18.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Proven traction: 235+ WhatsApp groups, 211,500+ participants</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; line-height: 149%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 149%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->AI-powered HubSpot + ChatGPT automation ensures consistent engagement and daily updates</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Expert-led guidance builds trust and adoption</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Real-time dashboards provide transparent KPIs and ESG reporting</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Single coordinated system enables scalable, predictable growth</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Footer / Tagline: </strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .45pt 0cm;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Powered by AGF company and HubSpot integrated with ChatGPT AI, AGF&rsquo;s platform delivers automated daily content, expert guidance, and community-driven product promotion, transforming communities into active growth channels for health, economic development, and global market expansion</span></p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 0, '2026-03-03 03:37:34', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 03:40:42', NULL, 1),
