(241, 23, 'texte', 'Expression of Interest (EOI) Form', 'Expression of Interest (EOI) Form', '<p>AFRICAN GREEN FARMERS LTD (AGF) invites qualified and compliant capital intermediaries to register their interest in supporting the mobilization of strategic funding for its integrated agro-industrial, bioeconomy and phytopharmaceutical development programs.</p>\r\n<p>This registration is directed to AFRICAN GREEN FARMERS LTD as the principal entity.</p>\r\n<p>Submission of this form does not constitute a mandate, exclusivity, or legally binding engagement. Any collaboration is subject to due diligence and execution of a formal agreement.</p>', NULL, 0, '', '', 1, '2026-03-04 18:21:33', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
